10. Given above, provided the petitioners are not required in any other case, the petitioners shall be released on bail in the FIR captioned above, in the following terms:
(a). Petitioners to furnish personal bond of Rs. Ten thousand (INR 10,000/-) each;
AND (b) To give one surety of Rs. Twenty-five thousand (INR 25,000/-) each, to the satisfaction of the concerned investigator/SHO.

